# Scenario 035 — Telecom NOC: event rule chains a completed analysis to the next stage
/reset
yes
/enterprise
Meridian Telecom NOC
Keep the network up with evidence-led analysis and accountable human control of every change.
q
/function
1
Fault Analysis
Analyse synthetic network faults and prepare an accountable recommendation.
skip
/function
1
Change Coordination
Prepare change options once a fault is analysed, for human approval.
skip
/add-human-worker
Shift Lead
1
skip
/function start "Fault Analysis"
/function start "Change Coordination"
@timeout 260
@staff /staff
/event rule add --when task.completed --job "Fault Analysis" --publish "Fault analysed"
/event rule list
/task
1
Analyse a synthetic scenario where a regional link shows rising packet loss during peak hours: evidence needed, likely causes at a high level, customer-impact questions, and the change decisions a shift lead must make. Do not issue a network change.
1
1
@note Work type, then go-ahead.
1
1
@wait 20
@cap TASK_ID {(task-[0-9]+)}
/tasks
@wait 8
/approve {{TASK_ID}}
@wait 55
/task inspect {{TASK_ID}}
/events
/timeline
